OL,3,A'It's been killing me!' Celebrity
OL,4,ATraitors winners relieved the secret is
OL,5,Aout
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I am feeling good, it's so nice to
OL,8,Ffinally be able to talk about it
OL,9,Fproperly," Croft, known to pals as
OL,10,FBash, told BBC Newsbeat.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
